Z||000006||Predator||10-04-2001||08:27 AM||||A more realistic number is I am running a pretty much stock 2.8 with a turbo setup. I run between 9 and 10 lbs of boost. I am running on the Dyno 178hp 217 Ftlbs torque. I was running a little rich though. Friday afternoon I am going on the Dyno again with a new chip so I will post if it helps the hp or not. I can't see 235 hp from a stock 2.8 with a turbo unless you are really boosting it. Maybe at the crank, but not at the wheels. <P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero4_1.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by Predator (edited 10-04-2001).]||||reg||1
