Z||000014||The Fieromaster||10-04-2001||01:48 PM||||DreXter - Youve got MAIL!<P>--- Yea i have a IHI Turbo that I am getting info on now... I think its capable of as much or more power as a T-4!!  I hope to obtain somewhere NEAR 375hp or more.  As for 1/4 times... I have a VERY acurate car testing program and the FIERO is in the program!!  I ran it with the turbo here is the info i got...<BR>Power - 375hp<BR>Rims - 17" w/ 245-40 series tires<BR>0-60 = 3.8 seconds<BR>1/4 mile = 12.2 @ 115mph<P>Id say thats all i need!! Thats a DAMN fast Fiero!!!  Enough to leave the ricers behind!<P><FONT SIZE="3"><B><FONT COLOR="purple"><sub>FIERO</sub><sup>MASTER</sup></FONT></B></FONT><BR>||||reg||1
